{"created": "2024-12-19T22:20:01.106667+00:00", "modified": "2025-02-14T02:38:53.126805+00:00", "id": 14498691, "conceptrecid": "14498690", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14498691", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14498690", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14498691", "metadata": {"title": "ASVspoof 5: Design, Collection and Validation of Resources for Spoofing, Deepfake, and Adversarial Attack Detection Using Crowdsourced Speech", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14498691", "publication_date": "2024-12-18", "description": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is the Zenodo repository for the ASVspoof 5 database. ASVspoof 5 is the fifth edition in a series of challenges which promote the study of speech spoofing and deepfake attacks, and the design of detection solutions. Compared to previous challenges, the ASVspoof~5 database is built from crowdsourced data collected from around 2,000 speakers in diverse acoustic conditions.&nbsp; More than 20 attacks, also crowdsourced, are generated and optionally tested using surrogate detection models, while seven adversarial attacks are incorporated for the first time.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please check README.txt and LICENSE.txt before downloading the database.</li>\n<li>Database paper (to be submitted): https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.08857\n<ul>\n<li>Please consider citing the reference listed at the bottom of this page.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>It is highly recommended to follow the rules and instructions in the ASVspoof 5 challenge evaluation plan (phase 2, https://www.asvspoof.org/), if you want to produce results comparable with the literature.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Latest work using the ASVspoof 5 database can be found in the Automatic Speaker Verification Spoofing Countermeasures Workshop proceeding: https://www.isca-archive.org/asvspoof_2024/index.html</li>\n<li>If you are interested in creating spoofed data for research purpose using the ASVspoof 5 protocol, please send request to info@asvspoof.org</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Wang, Xin", "affiliation": "National Institute of Informatics", "orcid": "0000-0001-8246-0606"}, {"name": "Delgado, H\u00e9ctor", "affiliation": "Nuance Communications Inc", "orcid": "0000-0002-4475-2517"}, {"name": "Tak, Hemlata", "affiliation": "Pindrop", "orcid": "0000-0002-0102-523X"}, {"name": "Jung, Jee-weon", "affiliation": "Apple", "orcid": "0000-0003-0505-2988"}, {"name": "Shim, Hyejin", "affiliation": "Carnegie Mellon University", "orcid": "0000-0002-5990-363X"}, {"name": "Todisco, Massimiliano", "affiliation": "EURECOM", "orcid": "0000-0002-6527-3558"}, {"name": "Kukanov, Ivan", "affiliation": "KLASS", "orcid": "0000-0003-4052-2754"}, {"name": "Liu, Xuechen", "affiliation": "National Institute of Informatics", "orcid": "0000-0003-1207-5651"}, {"name": "Sahidullah, Md", "affiliation": "TCG Crest", "orcid": "0000-0002-0624-2903"}, {"name": "Kinnunen, Tomi", "affiliation": "University of Eastern Finland", "orcid": "0000-0002-4371-7322"}, {"name": "Evans, Nicholas", "affiliation": "EURECOM", "orcid": "0000-0002-8459-1041"}, {"name": "Lee, Kong Aik", "affiliation": "The Hong Kong Polytechnic University", "orcid": "0000-0001-9133-3000"}, {"name": "Yamagishi, Junichi", "affiliation": "National Institute of Informatics", "orcid": "0000-0003-2752-3955"}, {"name": "Jeong, Myeonghun", "affiliation": "Seoul National University"}, {"name": "Zhu, Ge", "affiliation": "University of Rochester"}, {"name": "Zang, Yongyi", "affiliation": "University of Rochester"}, {"name": "Zhang, Neil", "affiliation": "University of Rochester"}, {"name": "Maiti, Soumi", "affiliation": "Carnegie Mellon University"}, {"name": "Lux, Florian", "affiliation": "University of Stuttgart"}, {"name": "Muller, Nicolas", "affiliation": "Fraunhofer Institute for Applied and Integrated Security"}, {"name": "Zhang, Wangyou", "affiliation": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University"}, {"name": "Sun, Chengzhe", "affiliation": "University at Buffalo"}, {"name": "Hou, Shuwei", "affiliation": "University at Buffalo"}, {"name": "Lyu, Siwei", "affiliation": "University at Buffalo"}, {"name": "Le Maguer, Sebastien", "affiliation": "University of Helsinki"}, {"name": "Gong, Cheng", "affiliation": "Tianjin University"}, {"name": "Guo, Hanjie", "affiliation": "University of Science and Technology of China"}, {"name": "Chen, Liping", "affiliation": "University of Science and Technology of China"}, {"name": "Singh, Vishwanath", "affiliation": "University of Eastern Finland"}], "keywords": ["anti-spoofing", "presentation attack detection", "speech deepfake detection"], "dates": [{"type": "available"}], "version": "v0.1", "references": ["Xin Wang, H\u00e9ctor Delgado, Hemlata Tak, Jee-weon Jung, Hye-jin Shim, Massimiliano Todisco, Ivan Kukanov, Xuechen Liu, Md Sahidullah, Tomi Kinnunen, Nicholas Evans, Kong Aik Lee, Junichi Yamagishi, Myeonghun Jeong, Ge Zhu, Yongyi Zang, You Zhang, Soumi Maiti, Florian Lux, Nicolas M\u00fcller, Wangyou Zhang, Chengzhe Sun, Shuwei Hou, Siwei Lyu, S\u00e9bastien Le Maguer, Cheng Gong, Hanjie Guo, Liping Chen, and Vishwanath Singh. 2024. ASVspoof 5: Design, Collection and Validation of Resources for Spoofing, Deepfake, and Adversarial Attack Detection Using Crowdsourced Speech. To be submmited (2024). https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.08857", "Xin Wang, H\u00e9ctor Delgado, Hemlata Tak, Jee-weon Jung, Hye-jin Shim, Massimiliano Todisco, Ivan Kukanov, Xuechen Liu, Md Sahidullah, Tomi Kinnunen, Nicholas Evans, Kong Aik Lee, and Junichi Yamagishi. 2024. ASVspoof 5: Crowdsourced speech data, deepfakes, and adversarial attacks at scale. In ASVspoof Workshop 2024, 2024. 1--8. https://doi.org/10.21437/ASVspoof.2024-1"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "odc-by"}, "grants": [{"code": "JPMJPR23P9", "internal_id": "00097mb19::JPMJPR23P9", "funder": {"name": "Japan Science and Technology Agency"}, "title": "PRESTO"}, {"code": "349605", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100002341::349605", "funder": {"name": "Research C